The core issue: [38;5;10mfind_just_split[0m tries to identify the "just split" node by checking [38;5;10m!right.used && !down.used[0m, but this heuristic can match the wrong node. The C code doesn't have this problem because it returns the pointer directly from [38;5;10msplit_bin_tree[0m.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
